      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're going through a really frightening time, and those feelings of losing yourself are incredibly heavy. Sometimes, feeling like you're fading is a sign that you're overwhelmed, and it's understandable that you're scared. Please know that these feelings are very common when we're under stress, and they don't mean you are actually disappearing. If these feelings persist, reaching out to a mental health professional can provide you with support and strategies to manage them.",
